  "descriptionMarkdown": "An updated version of Nytromance Games's plan, but actually functional: Correct underground pipe and belt lengths. Intended to allow one to begin with this tier of science, can be expanded if higher spm is desired.\n\nThis one is intended to be deployed after Energy 1 and/or Material 1, and as such I did not scale this one down.  It is assumed you have researched Hypercooling 3, but it is easy to adjust if you have not.  Once you have researched Thermal Radiating Efficiency there is room to add even more Thermal Radiators and switch all of them over to that:  But you had probably better have a tank full of warm thermofluid ready to empty into the system...\n\nFactorio 2.0, Krastorio 2, Space Exploration 0.7x, stringweasel's Valves mod, and xkyouchoux's Space Age Building Integration mods. Should be easy to adjust without the last two.",
